{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Out and About", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Why Don't We ...", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Here and There > The Neighborhood", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about free time activities or personal likes/dislikes in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Free Time Activities and Routine Activities", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Free time activities are things you do when you have the time.<br/>They are not routine activities.<br/>Routine activities are things you do every day or every week.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Free Time Activities\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Routine Activities\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go to the movies<br/>go for a walk<br/>go to a sports game<br/>listen to music<br/>go to a museum<br/>visit an art gallery<br/>go to a music festival\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"study<br/>shop for food<br/>go to school<br/>take the bus<br/>go to the gym<br/>eat  lunch<br/>drive to work\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "strong", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a powerful taste", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't like strong coffee.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you are shopping.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "anyway", "type": "name"}, {"content": "that doesn't matter", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He doesn't like going to the movies, but ask him anyway.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to eat out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have a meal at a restaurant", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's eat dinner out at Mario's tonight!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "often", "type": "name"}, {"content": "many times", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We often go to the mall.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a lot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large number of times.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They go to the museum a lot!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "all the time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "regularly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have sandwiches for lunch all the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressions of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "To talk about how often something happens, you use an expression of frequency. <br/>This can be an adverb like <span class = \"italic\">often</span>, <span class = \"italic\">sometimes</span>, <span class = \"italic\">never</span>.<br/>It can also be expression like <span class = \"italic\">a lot</span>, <span class = \"italic\">all the time</span>, <span class = \"italic\">when I can</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She goes to the mall all the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He doesn't come here often.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They eat in this restaurant a lot.", "type": "example"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go to your favorite shopping mall or shopping area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of things you can do there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find the English words for these activities in a dictionary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Write an invitation to a friend to go there and do something with you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write two or three sentences about the mall.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice the sentences out loud.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify things to do at the shopping mall.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use a dictionary to look up English words for the activities at the mall.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an invitation to go to the shopping mall.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice saying my sentences about the mall aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about likes and dislikes.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about activities that I do and their frequency.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about free time activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "How often do you go to a mall?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What do you do there? Do you shop? See a film? Have lunch?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " I love shopping at the mall! Do you?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": 